      </p>
      <p>
        OZ 2.0 reporting rules: IRC §§ 6039K, 6039L, 6726; P.L. 119-21.
        NMTC made permanent: P.L. 119-21 § [NMTC provision]; LIHTC changes: P.L. 119-21.
        Last reviewed: <time datetime="2026-05-06">May 6, 2026</time>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
